1
00:05:14,117 --> 00:05:20,117
Den Brother is a comedy, family, romance film directed by Mark L. Taylor.

2
00:10:28,235 --> 00:10:34,235
Alex Pearson has a lot to learn about teamwork.

3
00:15:42,352 --> 00:15:48,352
As the star of the Lemon Oaks hockey team, Alex almost
always has his way on and off the ice.

4
00:20:56,470 --> 00:21:02,470
That is until he pulls a stunt so outrageous not even
his own coach can give him a pass.

5
00:26:10,588 --> 00:26:16,588
His punishment?

6
00:31:24,705 --> 00:31:30,705
Suspension from the team, a never-ending list of chores and a job
watching his little sister Emily after school.

7
00:36:38,823 --> 00:36:44,823
Alex Pearson, played by Hutch Dano.

8
00:41:52,941 --> 00:41:58,941
Emily Pearson, played by Genevieve Hannelius.

9
00:47:07,058 --> 00:47:13,058
Dina Reams, played by Vicki Lewis.

10
00:52:21,176 --> 00:52:27,176
Matisse Burrows, played by Kelsey Asbille.

11
00:57:35,294 --> 00:57:41,294
Danny "Goose" Gustavo, played by David Lambert.

12
01:02:49,411 --> 01:02:55,411
Rachel Caitlyn, played by Kelly Gould.

13
01:08:03,529 --> 01:08:09,529
Den Brother is a 2010 American comedy-drama film
released as a Disney Channel Original Movie.

14
01:13:17,647 --> 01:13:23,647
It stars Hutch Dano and G Hannelius.

15
01:18:31,764 --> 01:18:37,764
The film premiered on August 13, 2010 on Disney Channel.

16
01:23:45,882 --> 01:23:51,882
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
